---
const columns = [
  {
    tag: ".vibe_coded_mvps",
    title: "Vibe-coded MVPs",
    body: "Demo on a weekend. Fall apart in week six. Multi-tenant ceiling, security debt, no taste.",
  },
  {
    tag: ".agencies",
    title: "Agencies",
    body: "Still selling hours. Six-month discoveries, rotating juniors, plateau after launch.",
  },
  {
    tag: ".freelancers",
    title: "Freelancers",
    body: "Ship code, not strategy. Can't tell you what to build. Continuity drifts the moment they're off the project.",
  },
];
---

<section class="text-cream py-24 md:py-[120px]" style="background: #2B2660;">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1180px] px-6">

    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-coral mb-10 tracking-wider">// the_catch_with_ai</p>

    <h2 class="font-serif text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl text-cream leading-[1.0] tracking-tight max-w-3xl mb-20">
      AI made shipping software cheap. It made shipping the <em class="not-italic text-coral">right</em> software harder.
    </h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-px rounded overflow-hidden" style="background: #3d3870;">
      {columns.map((col) => (
        <div class="p-8 md:p-10" style="background: #1F1B4A;">
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-coral mb-6">{col.tag}</p>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-cream mb-4">{col.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: #a09cbe;">{col.body}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <p class="mt-16 font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-snug max-w-3xl" style="color: #a09cbe;">
      Half the products launched in 2026 will be forgotten by Friday.{" "}
      <span class="text-cream">The ones that aren't will have a senior team behind them.</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
